OL,3,GNEWSAElizabeth Taylor's suitcase up for
OL,4,Aauction after Richard Burton sent it to
OL,5,Ahis sister
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurton was married five times, twice to
OL,8,FTaylor with whom he starred in 11
OL,9,Ffilms. Their relationship was born from
OL,10,Fan affair while filming Cleopatra
OL,11,Ftogether in the 1960s.
OL,13,FThe suitcase the clothes contained and
OL,14,Fthe letter Burton sent his sister are
OL,15,Famong a stash of Welsh memorabilia up
OL,16,Ffor auction on Thursday.
